{"id": "97110139", "name": "חוקי לוגריתמים – ln(x^m·y^k) או ln(x^m/y^k) בעזרת p = ln x, q = ln y", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p=\\ln x\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q=\\ln y\\)</span>, כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y>0\\)</span>.</p><p>בטאו את הביטוי הבא באמצעות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q\\)</span>:</p>[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left({{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}\\right) \\]</p>[[else]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{ {{CT:1}} }\\right) \\]</p>[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]\\( \\ln\\left({{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}\\right)= \\)[[else]]\\( \\ln\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{ {{CT:1}} }\\right)= \\)[[/if]] [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כפל מסמנים בכוכבית. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">7*p-4*q</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> משתמשים בחוקי הלוגריתמים (מותר, כי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x,y>0\\)</span>): קודם הופכים את הלוגריתם של [[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]המכפלה לסכום[[else]]המנה להפרש[[/if]] של לוגריתמים, ואחר כך מוציאים את החזקות ככפל.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — לוגריתם של [[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]מכפלה[[else]]מנה[[/if]]</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]הלוגריתם של מכפלה הוא סכום הלוגריתמים, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln(AB)=\\ln A+\\ln B\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left({{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}\\right)=\\ln\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)+\\ln\\left({{CT:1}}\\right) \\]</p>[[else]]הלוגריתם של מנה הוא הפרש הלוגריתמים, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\frac{A}{B}=\\ln A-\\ln B\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{ {{CT:1}} }\\right)=\\ln\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)-\\ln\\left({{CT:1}}\\right) \\]</p>[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הוצאת החזקות</b><br>חזקה בתוך לוגריתם יוצאת ככפל: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\left(u^r\\right)=r\\ln u\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)={{CT:3}}\\ln x={{CT:4}} \\]</p>[[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)={{CT:5}}\\ln y={{CT:6}} \\]</p>[[else]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln y=q \\]</p>[[/if]]מציבים ומקבלים:[[if test=\"{{CT:2}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left({{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}\\right)={{CT:7}} \\]</p>[[else]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:0}} }{ {{CT:1}} }\\right)={{CT:7}} \\]</p>[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:Result]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mp_plus_q", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "mp_plus_q", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wrong1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">נראה שהשתמשתם ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\left(x^m\\right)=\\left(\\ln x\\right)^m\\)</span>, וזה לא נכון. החזקה יוצאת מהלוגריתם ככפל: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\left(x^m\\right)=m\\ln x\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wrong2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הלוגריתם של מכפלה הוא <b>סכום</b> הלוגריתמים, והלוגריתם של מנה הוא <b>הפרש</b> הלוגריתמים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln(AB)=\\ln A+\\ln B\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\frac{A}{B}=\\ln A-\\ln B\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wrong3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בדקו את הסימן של המחובר עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln(AB)=\\ln A+\\ln B\\)</span> ואילו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\frac{A}{B}=\\ln A-\\ln B\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "m", "mp_plus_q", "s", "wrong1", "wrong2", "wrong3", "xm", "yk"], "nvariants": 24}